                        "sense_id": "4ba1c1d9-0486-36ca-b2f4-4db62806088a",
                        "entry_id": "8ad8be30-d2f1-3d97-aef5-5b1d575c2f1a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The formation of a trust to hold and manage something, especially one that has monopolistic control."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8c78934-c035-4c08-ab47-e871463e0004",
                                "sense_id": "4ba1c1d9-0486-36ca-b2f4-4db62806088a",
                                "text": "Let me repeat that this Bill is a definite link in the international trustification of public credit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1acc075d-6548-4287-b122-c40826e28fc6",
                                "sense_id": "4ba1c1d9-0486-36ca-b2f4-4db62806088a",
                                "text": "On the other hand certain forms of amalgamation have been tempting enough to foster a sort of trustification which may not have been justified by the existing conditions of competition."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "032a483b-c97f-4fcf-9e1e-c25fea74be24",
                                "sense_id": "4ba1c1d9-0486-36ca-b2f4-4db62806088a",
                                "text": "Under the presidency of Theodore Roosevelt, and even more under Taft, new proceedings were started, this time against trustifications through holding companies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01e82c69-e1c2-461d-b08a-9f45db7bcb24",
                                "sense_id": "4ba1c1d9-0486-36ca-b2f4-4db62806088a",
                                "text": "The appeal of trustification, for example, was limited by cultural and sociopolitical considerations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1986857-febe-4bda-8206-9cd6b2ac5b4e",
                                "sense_id": "4ba1c1d9-0486-36ca-b2f4-4db62806088a",
                                "text": "...there has of late been a tendency towards a much more pronounced amalgamation and trustification in industry."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
